 beside the Homewood campus","notes":"Reserve a free general-admission ticket, pick one gallery as your focus, and ask the Welcome Desk about any separately ticketed exhibitions.","short_summary":"Spend a focused hour with art at Homewood’s museum neighbor.","evidence_claim":"The BMA states that general admission is always free with a reservation and lists its address as 10 Art Museum Drive in Charles Village.","source_url":"https://artbma.org/plan-your-visit/","source_title":"Plan Your Visit | Baltimore Museum of Art","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open Wednesday–Sunday, 10 a.m.–5 p.m.; reserve free general admission. Special exhibitions may require tickets.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jhu-first-weekend-bma-sculpture-gardens","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"BMA Sculpture Gardens","title":"Saturday: Walk the Sculpture Gardens","subtitle":"An outdoor art stop at 10 Art Museum Drive","notes":"Follow the garden paths after the galleries, photograph works only within posted rules, and keep a weather backup for closures.","short_summary":"Shift from indoor galleries to an outdoor art walk next to campus.","evidence_claim":"The BMA lists its Sculpture Gardens as part of the visitor experience and says they are open Wednesday through Sunday, weather permitting.","source_url":"https://artbma.org/plan-your-visit/","source_title":"Plan Your Visit | Baltimore Museum of Art","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open Wednesday–Sunday, 10 a.m.–5 p.m., weather permitting; severe weather or temperature extremes can close the gardens.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jhu-first-weekend-wyman-park-dell","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Wyman Park Dell",